<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex lower jet fuel prices.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex lower jet fuel prices.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) said Tuesday it lowered jet fuel prices to 1,872.00 pesos per cubic meter, from a previous 1,889.27 pesos per cubic meter.</p>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas monopoly periodically adjusts jet fuel prices in line with international market prices.</p>
<p>Jet fuel prices began 1996 at 1,253.50 pesos per cubic meter, Pemex said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903</p>
